      "side": 1,
      "message": "UART debugging usually impact the timing of normal operation, a well known fact to SW developers, but didn\u0027t expect in this case as 115K (UART) vs 300K/600K at comparable level. But agree, most timeouts in PD are also in some msec order and might have negative impact, and better to be filtered by debug_level.",
